# ============================================================
# DO NOT IGNORE
#
# The following important source files remain tracked:
#
# *.sv       SystemVerilog RTL / testbenches
# *.v        Verilog
# *.vh       Verilog headers
# *.xdc      FPGA constraints
# *.py       Python scripts / golden model
# *.md       Documentation
# *.txt      Documentation / configuration
# *.json     Configuration/data
# *.xpr      Vivado project
#
# ============================================================